# The views of streaming-shots at a low sun, for the ray scene with the landscape by chunks (step 1c of the RT
# revisit, reports/render-features/2026-11-08-rt-revisit/step-1c.md): a sun shadow ray from a hit is longer than the
# Far range (1 km), so a hill beyond it that shades the view goes missing. Run with OPENGOTHIC_RT=1 OPENGOTHIC_GI=1,
# once with OPENGOTHIC_STREAMING=0 and once without it, and compare the pairs cell by cell
# (scripts/gi_compare.py --tolerance 5). 20:30: the sun 12.6 degrees high in the west; 6:00: 15 degrees in the east.
seed 73013
deterministic on
cheat god
world-check NEWWORLD.ZEN
set time 20 30
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off
watch player
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
freeze PAL_203_LOTHAR
cam look 120
cam world 700 280 0
wait 10000
cam hold
streaming wait
shot low-sun-market
wait 34
goto pos 5391 320 -5822
cam look 120
cam world 850 300 0
wait 10000
cam hold
streaming wait
shot low-sun-harbour
wait 34
goto NW_FOREST_PATH_16
cam look 150
cam world 500 230 0
wait 10000
cam hold
streaming wait
shot low-sun-forest
wait 34
# Above the lighthouse, looking inland across the city towards the distant forest (range 300-800 m).
goto pos 30000 4000 -12000
cam look 120
cam world 42000 6500 138.5
wait 10000
cam hold
streaming wait
shot low-sun-island
wait 34
set time 6 0
wait 10000
cam hold
streaming wait
shot low-sun-island-morning
wait 34
